- Your reasoning MUST be specific and dense (2-4 sentences). Include: (1) trend direction with specific EMA values, (2) each algorithm signal awarded or denied with the data that drove it, (3) each discretionary point awarded or denied with justification, (4) the volatility regime and its impact. Do not give one-line answers.
- LENGTH LIMITS (hard; longer output is rejected and wastes a retry): reasoning at most {{ analyst_reasoning_max_chars }} characters, so aim for about {{ (analyst_reasoning_max_chars * 3) // 4 }}; at most {{ max_key_levels }} key levels, each reason at most {{ key_level_reason_max_chars }} characters. Abbreviate (EMA20>50>200, RSI 58, vol 1.3x) instead of writing full sentences for each signal.
